WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.654
Thin trees, found fast.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.740
Every cut here has many edges. Can

3
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:06.681
one spanning tree use few of each?

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.187
Halve the edges repeatedly, every cut halving

5
00:00:11.187 --> 00:00:13.574
too, until one thin tree is left.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.498
Claimed: always, in polynomial time.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.916
Main theorem in Lean.
